   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Hard graphic light: median ~74, olive-yellow shadows (33,34,27), green-yellow highlights (210,212,204), orange 30% + blue 22% + red 22%, saturation 0.32. Yellow-green warmth against blue. Best for: Midday hard light, painted walls and signage, yellow and blue colour blocks, sunny city streets, beach-town frames. Graphic and sunny.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
